/p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA flying book attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>With the Summer 2025 Update, this creature's classification in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Cyclopedia's</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bestiary%2FClasses\">Bestiary</a> was changed from <a href=\"#/wiki/Bestiary%2FClasses\">Magical</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Bestiary%2FClasses\">Inkborn</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,723 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Possessed_Objects\">Possessed Objects</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Feather\">Animated Feather</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Biting%20Book\">Biting Book</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burning%20Book\">Burning Book</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Book\">